'''Alolan Ninetales''' (Japanese: '''アローラキュウコン''' ''Alolan Kyukon'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

