==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Ninetales}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Alolan Ninetales|145}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*{{m|Blizzard}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Alolan Ninetales can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

